      "message": "fix(tests): lathe_post_css's Gate map names the crates its modules live in\n\nThe Gate map named app::post, but the post suite's module lives in the\npost crate since the M4.1 split, so the xtask test\nno_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app failed on main. Name it post::post,\nas #965 did for the other headers. The other entries (app::cutting,\napp::cutting_turn, app::commands, app::posting, app::project, tools::turning_data)\nwere checked against crates/*/src and are correct.\n\nFixes #1184\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
